<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-PacDun appoints Ralph deputy chair.</title>
<headline>RTRS-PacDun appoints Ralph deputy chair.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial conglomerate Pacific Dunlop Ltd said that John Ralph would be appointed deputy chairman.</p>
<p>&quot;For some time the position of deputy chairman has been vacant. I am pleased to advise that John Ralph has accepted the board's invitation to assume this role from the annual general meeting in November,&quot; Pacific Dunlop John Gough said in a statement. Ralph has been a director since 1994.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
